<title>USA: Centerpoint Properties Corp Q1 net higher.</title>
<headline>Centerpoint Properties Corp Q1 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net			  5,671		    3,627</p>
<p> Revs			19,729		   13,919</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,365		   12,770</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	18,073		   13,905</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Funds from operations were $9,160,000, or $0.51/shr diluted vs 6,482,000, or $0.47/shr.</p>
<p>Funds available for distribution were $8,085,000, or $0.45/shr vs $5,940,000, or $0.43/shr.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
